SceneSmith (https://github.com/nepfaff/scenesmith)
  The four simulated environments are adapted from scenes generated with
  SceneSmith (Pfaff et al., "SceneSmith: Agentic Generation of
  Simulation-Ready Indoor Scenes", ICML 2026). The articulated objects in
  each scene were converted from SceneSmith assets into MJCF. Each scene's
  package.xml carries the license declared by SceneSmith's scene generator.
